{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/OAuthController"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"authenticate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor7RequestC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Request"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor8ResponseC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Response"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Vernissage"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:16VernissageServer15OAuthControllerV12authenticate7request5Vapor8ResponseCAF7RequestC_tYaYbKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"authenticate(request:)"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/vernissageserver\/oauthcontroller\/authenticate(request:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Authorization endpoint - used by the client to obtain authorization from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the resource owner via user-agent redirection.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"authenticate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor7RequestC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Request"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor8ResponseC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Response"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The authorization endpoint is used to interact with the resource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owner and obtain an authorization grant.  The authorization server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"MUST first verify the identity of the resource owner.  The way in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which the authorization server authenticates the resource owner"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g., username and password login, session cookies) is beyond the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scope of this specification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, the client directs the user-agent to make the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HTTP request using TLS:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CURL request:"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["curl \"https:\/\/example.com\/api\/v1\/oauth\/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=s6BhdRkqt3&state=xyz&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fclient%2Eexample%2Ecom%2Fcb\" \\","-X GET"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After that request user is redirected to login page (it it’s not already signed in)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or to authorization page. After authorization redirection to specified "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redirect_uri"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is done (with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code"},{"type":"text","text":" which can be replaced for the access token in token endpoint)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documen